{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/CS/OperatingSystem/system_call/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"6f8decb7-3cd6-5914-97e6-0964fdfd2884","html":"<h1 id=\"시스템-콜\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%8B%9C%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%9C-%EC%BD%9C\" aria-label=\"시스템 콜 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>시스템 콜</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>System Call</strong> : 운영 체제의 커널이 제공하는 서비스에 대해, 응용 프로그램의 요청에 따라 커널에 접근하기 위한 인터페이스  </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50.55555555555556%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"시스템 콜\"\n        title=\"시스템 콜\"\n        src=\"/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/37523/system_call.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/e9ff0/system_call.png 180w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/f21e7/system_call.png 360w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/37523/system_call.png 720w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/302a4/system_call.png 1080w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/47218/system_call.png 1344w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>사용자 모드</strong> : 하드웨어에 직접 접근 불가능 (시스템 보호 목적)  </li>\n<li><strong>커널 모드</strong> : 모든 시스템 메모리와 CPU에 접근 가능, 하드웨어에 직접 접근 가능  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>→ 사용자 모드에서 커널 모드로 전환하기 위해 필요한 인터페이스 ⇒ <strong>시스템 콜</strong>  </p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"작동\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%91%EB%8F%99\" aria-label=\"작동 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>작동</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>사용자 프로세스가 시스템 콜 → 커널 모드 진입  </li>\n<li><strong>커널</strong>: 내부적으로 시스템 콜 구분하기 위해 기능 별로 고유번호 할당하고 해당 번호의 제어 루틴 정의  </li>\n<li><strong>커널</strong>: 요청 받은 시스템 콜에 대응하는 번호 확인하고 해당 서비스 루틴 호출  </li>\n<li><strong>커널</strong>: 서비스 루틴 처리하고 사용자 모드로 전환  </li>\n</ol>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"유형\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9C%A0%ED%98%95\" aria-label=\"유형 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>유형</h2>\n<h3 id=\"프로세스-제어\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EC%A0%9C%EC%96%B4\" aria-label=\"프로세스 제어 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>프로세스 제어</h3>\n<p>프로세스 실행, 생성, 대기 등  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>fork()</strong> : child 프로세스 생성  </li>\n<li><strong>exec()</strong> : 프로그램 실행  </li>\n<li><strong>wait()</strong> : 대기  </li>\n<li><strong>exit()</strong> : 현재 프로세스 종료  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"파일-조작\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EC%A1%B0%EC%9E%91\" aria-label=\"파일 조작 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>파일 조작</h3>\n<p>파일 열기, 읽기, 쓰기, 닫기 등  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>open()</strong> : 열기  </li>\n<li><strong>create()</strong> : 생성  </li>\n<li><strong>delete()</strong> : 삭제  </li>\n<li><strong>read()</strong> : 읽기  </li>\n<li><strong>write()</strong> : 쓰기  </li>\n<li><strong>close()</strong> : 닫기  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"장치-관리\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%B9%98-%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC\" aria-label=\"장치 관리 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>장치 관리</h3>\n<p>디바이스 부착, 분리, 읽기, 쓰기  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ioctl()</strong> : 장치 제어  </li>\n<li><strong>read()</strong> : 읽기  </li>\n<li><strong>write()</strong> : 쓰기  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"정보-유지\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EB%B3%B4-%EC%9C%A0%EC%A7%80\" aria-label=\"정보 유지 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정보 유지</h3>\n<p>시간/날짜 설정  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>getpid()</strong> : get 프로세스 ID  </li>\n<li><strong>alarm()</strong> : 일정 시간 후 alarm 시그널 전달  </li>\n<li><strong>sleep()</strong> : 지정 시간 만큼 대기  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"통신\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%86%B5%EC%8B%A0\" aria-label=\"통신 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>통신</h3>\n<p>통신 연결 생성, 제거, 상태 정보 전달  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>pipe()</strong> : 내부 통신을 위한 채널 생성  </li>\n<li><strong>shm_open()</strong> : 공유 메모리 객체를 생성 후에 해당 객체에 접근할 수 있는 파일 디스크립터 반환  </li>\n<li><strong>mmap()</strong> : 메모리 특정 공간에 파일 매핑  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"보호\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B3%B4%ED%98%B8\" aria-label=\"보호 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>보호</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>chmod()</strong> : 파일 권한 변경  </li>\n<li><strong>umask()</strong> : 새로 생성되는 파일 권한 제한  </li>\n<li><strong>chown()</strong> : 파일 소유자 변경  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://c4u-rdav.tistory.com/85\">https://c4u-rdav.tistory.com/85</a></p>","excerpt":"시스템 콜 System Call : 운영 체제의 커널이 제공하는 서비스에 대해, 응용 프로그램의 요청에 따라 커널에 접근하기 위한 인터페이스      사용자 모드 : 하드웨어에 직접 접근 불가능 (시스템 보호 목적)   커널 모드 : 모든 시스템 메모리와 CPU에 접근 가능, 하드웨어에 직접 접근 가능   → 사용자 모드에서 커널 모드로 전환하기 위해 필요한 인터페이스 ⇒ 시스템 콜    작동 사용자 프로세스가 시스템 콜 → 커널 모드 진입   커널: 내부적으로 시스템 콜 구분하기 위해 기능 별로 고유번호 할당하고 해당 번호의 제어 루틴 정의   커널: 요청 받은 시스템 콜에 대응하는 번호 확인하고 해당 서비스 루틴 호출   커널: 서비스 루틴 처리하고 사용자 모드로 전환    유형 프로세스 제어 프로세스 실행, 생성, 대기 등   fork() : child 프로세스 생성   exec() : 프로그램 실행   wait() : 대기   exit() : 현재 프로세스 종료    파일 …","frontmatter":{"date":"August 22, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - 시스템 콜","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/system_call/"}},"next":{"id":"8a57be77-efc1-56fb-ad89-2cf8ad7c6df5","html":"<h1 id=\"async--await\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#async--await\" aria-label=\"async  await permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async &#x26; await</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">AsyncFunction</code>객체를 반환하는 하나의 비동기 함수를 정의합니다. 비동기 함수는 이벤트 루프를 통해 비동기적으로 작동하는 함수로, 암시적으로 <code class=\"language-text\">Promise</code>를 사용하여 결과를 반환합니다.  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>param<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> param<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">...</span> param<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        statements\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p>→ Promise의 단점을 보완해주는 비동기 처리 방식</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"async\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#async\" aria-label=\"async permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>함수 선언 시 <strong>함수</strong> 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">async</code>  </li>\n<li>promise 객체 반환<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"awiat\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#awiat\" aria-label=\"awiat permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>awiat</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>promise 객체</strong> 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">await</code>  </li>\n<li>promise가 완료될 때까지 대기  </li>\n<li>async 함수 내부에서만 사용 가능<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"사용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용</h2>\n<p>await 키워드를 붙인 비동기 작업이 완료될 때까지 대기했다가 다음 작업을 수행한다.  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">ms</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Promise</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">resolve</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>resolve<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ms<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Task 1'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">3000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Task 2'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token function\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 506px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"async &amp; await 사용 예시\"\n        title=\"async &amp; await 사용 예시\"\n        src=\"/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/29f4e/async_and_await_example.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/e9ff0/async_and_await_example.png 180w,\n/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/f21e7/async_and_await_example.png 360w,\n/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/29f4e/async_and_await_example.png 506w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 506px) 100vw, 506px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"promise-vs-asyncawait\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#promise-vs-asyncawait\" aria-label=\"promise vs asyncawait permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Promise VS async/await</h2>\n<h3 id=\"promise\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#promise\" aria-label=\"promise permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Promise</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.888888888888886%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"promise hell 예시 코드\"\n        title=\"promise hell 예시 코드\"\n        src=\"/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/37523/promise_hell.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/e9ff0/promise_hell.png 180w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/f21e7/promise_hell.png 360w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/37523/promise_hell.png 720w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/302a4/promise_hell.png 1080w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/bb072/promise_hell.png 1318w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">postId</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Post:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">result</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Comments:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">catch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">error</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ promise 체이닝으로 인한 <code class=\"language-text\">.then() 지옥</code>의 가능성 (가독성 저하)<br>\n→ <code class=\"language-text\">.catch()</code>문을 통해 에러 핸들링<br>\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"asyncawait\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#asyncawait\" aria-label=\"asyncawait permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async/await</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">getResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> postId_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> comments_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postId_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Post:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Comments:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> comments_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\tconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  \n<span class=\"token function\">getResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ <code class=\"language-text\">.then()</code> 중첩 없이 간결하게 표현 가능<br>\n→ <code class=\"language-text\">try-catch()</code>문을 통해 에러 핸들링 (에러 발생 위치 알기 쉬움)<br>\n→ 비동기 작업 흐름을 명확하게 보여줌  </p>\n<h3 id=\"try-catch\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#try-catch\" aria-label=\"try catch permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>try-catch</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 예외가 발생할 수 있는 코드</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">exampleFunction</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 오류 처리를 위한 코드</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">error</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'오류가 발생했습니다:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> error<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<ol>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 실행  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 내에서 예외/오류가 발생 → 해당 블록 내 코드 실행 즉시 중단, 해당 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록으로 이동 (<code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 내 오류가 없을 경우 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 건너뛰고 계속 진행)  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 내의 코드 실행  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 실행 후, 이후 프로그램 계속 진행<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/JS-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-async-await\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/JS-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-async-await</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 16, 2023","title":"[Web] JS - async & await","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/"}},"prev":{"id":"a6fb569a-4256-5ace-a9b6-9e4779e8c744","html":"<h1 id=\"인터럽트\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%9F%BD%ED%8A%B8\" aria-label=\"인터럽트 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>인터럽트</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Interrupt</strong>: CPU가 프로그램을 실행하고 있을 때, 입출력 하드웨어 등의 장치 또는\n예외상황이 발생하여 처리가 필요한 경우 CPU에게 알려 처리할 수 있도록 하는 것.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>→ CPU의 작업을 방해하는 신호</strong>\n<br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"종류\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\" aria-label=\"종류 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>종류</h2>\n<h3 id=\"하드웨어-인터럽트\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%98%EB%93%9C%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4-%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%9F%BD%ED%8A%B8\" aria-label=\"하드웨어 인터럽트 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>하드웨어 인터럽트</h3>\n<p>: CPU가 아닌 다른 하드웨어 장치가 CPU에 어떤 사실을 알려주거나 CPU 서비스를 요청해야할 경우 발생</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>외부 인터럽트</strong> : 외부 입출력 장치에 의해 발생  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>전원 이상 인터럽트</strong> : 정전, 파워 이상  </li>\n<li><strong>기계 착오 인터럽트</strong> : CPU 기능 오류  </li>\n<li><strong>외부 신호 인터럽트</strong> : 타이머, 키보드, 외부 장치 인터럽트  </li>\n<li><strong>입출력 인터럽트</strong> : 입출력 데이터 오류, 입출력 장치의 데이터 전송 요구, 다음 동작 수행 요구  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>내부 인터럽트 :</strong> 잘못된 명령이나 잘못된 데이터 사용할 때 발생 (Trap)  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>프로그램 검사 입터럽트</strong> : 0으로 나눈 경우, Overflow/Underflow, 기타 예외 상황  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"소프트웨어-인터럽트\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%86%8C%ED%94%84%ED%8A%B8%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4-%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%9F%BD%ED%8A%B8\" aria-label=\"소프트웨어 인터럽트 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>소프트웨어 인터럽트</h3>\n<p>: 프로그램 처리 중 명령 요청에 의해서 발생  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SVG</strong> : 복잡한 입출력 처리, 사용자가 프로그램 실행 / 감시 프로그램 호출 동작 수행  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"처리-과정\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-%EA%B3%BC%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\"처리 과정 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>처리 과정</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 594px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 22.22222222222222%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"인터럽트 동작 원리\"\n        title=\"인터럽트 동작 원리\"\n        src=\"/static/d8a1db7f88f8f2e7a768671e5437c4a0/5fd3e/interrupt_process.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d8a1db7f88f8f2e7a768671e5437c4a0/e9ff0/interrupt_process.png 180w,\n/static/d8a1db7f88f8f2e7a768671e5437c4a0/f21e7/interrupt_process.png 360w,\n/static/d8a1db7f88f8f2e7a768671e5437c4a0/5fd3e/interrupt_process.png 594w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 594px) 100vw, 594px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<ol>\n<li>인터럽트 요청 발생  </li>\n<li>\n<p>프로그램 수행 중단  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>현재 수행 중인 명령의 수행이 완료된 시점에서 중단  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>현재 실행 중인 프로그램 상태 보관  </li>\n<li>\n<p>인터럽트 처리 실행  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>원인 판단  </li>\n<li>서비스 루틴 결정 &#x26; 호출  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>인터럽트 서비스 루틴(ISR) 수행  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>인터럽트 해결  </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>상태 복구  </li>\n<li>중단된 프로그램 실행 재개  </li>\n</ol>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"우선순위\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9A%B0%EC%84%A0%EC%88%9C%EC%9C%84\" aria-label=\"우선순위 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>우선순위</h2>\n<p><strong>→ 보류 중인 인터럽트 세트 중 어느 것이 먼저 서비스되는지</strong></p>\n<p><em>전원 이상 > 기계 착오 > 외부 신호 > 입출력 > 명령어 잘못 > 프로그램 검사 > SVC</em></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 22, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - 인터럽트","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/interrupt/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/system_call/","nextSlug":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/","prevSlug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/interrupt/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}